# Google OAuth Client ID — required for "Continue with Google" on Login / Register
# Get one at: https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials
#   → Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID → Application type: Web application
#   → Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173 (dev) + https://yourdomain.com (prod)
#   → Authorized redirect URIs: not required (implicit/token flow used here)
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your Client ID:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
